[{:db/id -1, :adr/id "adr-2605261500-suki-farm-tractor-tier-b-actor-r0", :adr/title "suki (鋤) — Farm Tractor Manufacturing Tier-B Actor R0 Scaffold", :adr/status "proposed", :adr/doc_type "adr", :adr/source-format "edn", :adr/body "\n# ADR-2605261500: suki (鋤) — Farm Tractor Manufacturing Tier-B Actor R0 Scaffold\n\n**Date**: 2026-05-26\n**Status**: PROPOSED\n**Deciders**: Jun Kawasaki (author), Council Lv6+ (ratify)\n**ADR Hierarchy**: Manufacturing-side counterpart of mitsuho operator-side (ADR-2605261015); sibling pattern parallel to sarutahiko (ADR-2605252500) / wadachi (ADR-2605242000)\n\n## Context\n\nEuropean farm tractor manufacturing (Fendt / AGCO / Claas / Massey Ferguson / Valtra / Deutz-Fahr / Same / Kubota / Case IH / New Holland / John Deere EU class) は年間 ~30 万台規模で 50-500 馬力級農業用トラクターを製造する factory pipeline。Frame welding + engine/transmission/hydraulic assembly + cab forming + paint + final assembly + drawbar/PTO/3-point hitch test — 全 layer が **proprietary ECU + DRM-locked CAN bus + dealer-only diagnostics + 接着剤 + 修理 vendor 限定 + 大規模化 KPI + 化石燃料前提** で industry-default。\n\n**Methodology source**: YouTube `aSmoLQKdX9E` — \"Inside Ultra-Modern European Factories Building Massive Farm Tractors From Scratch\" (European farm tractor factory build documentary; frame fabrication + powertrain + cab + paint + electrical + drawbar test pipeline). Manufacturing methodology のみ採用、John Deere-class DRM ECU / dealer-locked diagnostics / patent-locked seed integration / mega-farm consolidation / fossil-fuel-only powertrain / surveillance-hardware integration は religious-corp として **構造的に拒否**。\n\nreligious-corp は wadachi (autonomous-mobility operator-side), sarutahiko (heavy truck manufacturing-side), igata (HPDC), kanayama (circular metallurgy), watatsumi (civilian submersible), tsutae (handheld), mitsuho (food/agriculture operator-side) と並んで **farm tractor manufacturing (agricultural mobility manufacturer)** を独立 Tier-B actor として立ち上げる必要がある。\n\n理由:\n\n1. **Agricultural mobility = mitsuho operator-side enabler**: mitsuho.cells.harvest_robotics + field_cultivation は tractor / cultivator を operate するが、自前の tractor manufacturing 無しでは John Deere / AGCO Fendt / Kubota commercial supply chain dependency。**§2(b) anti-IP locking + §2(e) anti-gatekeeping** の constitutional 違反が constitutive dependency に組み込まれる。\n2. **Right-to-Repair landmark constitutional first**: John Deere の DRM-locked ECU (2018 US FTC settlement + 2023 Memorandum of Understanding) は consumer protection regulatory landmark。religious-corp は **G10 + N4 constitutional Right-to-Repair invariant** として religious-corp 内で R2R を device level (tsutae G3) + firmware level (suki G10) の dual-layer 構造的成立。これは **religious-corp first explicit Right-to-Repair constitutional first-class invariant**。\n3. **Manufacturing-side / operator-side sibling**: sarutahiko (truck manufacturing) ↔ wadachi (truck operation) の pattern を suki (tractor manufacturing) ↔ mitsuho.harvest_robotics (tractor operation) で再現。Single physical artifact (tractor) を two domain-distinct actor scaffold に split。constitutional 透明性が向上。\n4. **§2(b) anti-IP locking applied to agricultural firmware**: G9 (open ECU + open CAN bus + open hydraulic control) + G10 (no dealer-locked diagnostics) + N4 (closed ECU NEVER) + N5 (patent-locked seed integration NEVER, e.g., John Deere SeedStar planters lock seed brand) = **agricultural firmware の constitutional liberation**。tsutae G2 (smartphone bootloader unlock default) の tractor 翻訳。\n5. **§1.13 Wellbecoming + 多世代 ag-autonomy**: 小規模農家の land-relationship が大規模 corporate ag に飲み込まれる構造的力 (John Deere mega-tractor 600 hp + farm consolidation) を、religious-corp は **G12 Wave 1 ≤200 hp + N3 mega-tractor (≥400 hp) DEFERRED post-R3 + Council Lv6+ supermajority** で構造的に拒否。**multi-gen farmer-land-relationship** が constitutional に protected。\n6. **Operator-required (SAE Level ≤3) constitutional**: N6 = SAE Level 5 (full autonomous tractor) NEVER。wadachi G7 + sarutahiko G12 parity。farmer-land relationship は §1.13 Wellbecoming の物理基盤。**operator human-in-seat invariant** で多世代 ag-autonomy を構造的に preserve。assistive autonomy (guidance, headland turning) は OK; unattended operation は NEVER。\n7. **G7 fuel transition synced with sarutahiko**: R0/R1 = B100 biodiesel + diesel hybrid (industry-realistic onboarding); R2+ = LFP / H₂ / methanol fuel-cell only (sarutahiko G7 fossil sunset parallel)。religious-corp 第 2 actor with declared phase-gate fuel transition。\n\nこのため、独立 Tier-B actor として **suki (鋤 — plow; foundational agricultural artisan tool)** を提案する。silicon Wave 1 iwakura (磐座) / fuigo (鞴) / igata (鋳型) / kanayama (金山) と同じ「物事/工房道具/概念で命名」系譜。多世代 agricultural craft echo (古事記 から伊勢神宮 御田植祭 まで連続する agricultural tool kami)。\n\n## Proposal\n\nreligious-corp Tier-B actor **suki (鋤)** を以下で立ち上げる:\n\n- **Actor DID**: `did:web:etzhayyim.com:suki`\n- **Namespace**: `com.etzhayyim.suki.*`\n- **R0 scope**: Farm tractor assembly (~50-200 hp Wave 1; community-scale farming target; **mega-tractor ≥400 hp deferred to N3**; Wave 2 = orchard / vineyard specialty < 50 hp; Wave 3 = cultivator-only walk-behind ≤ 25 hp deferred)\n- **R0 deliverable**: Scaffold only (9 cells import-time RuntimeError + 9 lexicon stub + actor scaffold)\n- **14 constitutional gates G1..G14 + 12 non-goals N1..N12** declared (matches sarutahiko + tsutae density)\n- **Methodology source attribution**: YouTube `aSmoLQKdX9E` European farm tractor factory build documentary; manufacturing methodology adopted; John Deere-class DRM ECU + dealer-locked diagnostics + patent-locked seed integration + mega-farm consolidation + fossil-fuel-only + surveillance hardware integration all explicitly rejected\n\n## Rationale\n\n1. **Mitsuho operator-side independence**: mitsuho.cells.harvest_robotics needs tractors; without suki, religious-corp depends on John Deere / Kubota commercial supply chain (§2(b) IP licensing violation at constitutional core agriculture).\n2. **Right-to-Repair constitutional first-class invariant**: G10 + N4 establish religious-corp's first explicit RTR invariant at firmware level. tsutae G3 covered device-level R2R (modular hardware); suki G10 covers ECU/firmware R2R. **Dual-layer R2R constitutional**: hardware (tsutae G3) + firmware (suki G10).\n3. **Sibling pattern continuity**: sarutahiko ↔ wadachi (truck) precedent → suki ↔ mitsuho.harvest_robotics (tractor). Same physical artifact, two domain-distinct actor scaffold pattern stabilized.\n4. **Anti-corporate-ag invariant**: G12 (≤200 hp Wave 1) + N3 (mega-tractor ≥400 hp post-R3 Council Lv6+ supermajority) preserve small-farmer scale. Combined with mitsuho G2 (seed sovereignty) + G6 (no synthetic pesticides), establishes religious-corp **agricultural constitutional autonomy**.\n5. **Wadachi G7 echo (operator-required)**: N6 SAE Level 5 NEVER preserves farmer-land relationship. Tractors with operator only; assistive autonomy (guidance, headland turning) acceptable; unattended operation NEVER.\n6. **Sarutahiko G7 fuel transition parallel**: R0/R1 B100 biodiesel + diesel hybrid → R2+ LFP / H₂ / methanol fuel-cell only. religious-corp 第 2 actor declared phase-gate fuel transition.\n7. **Cross-actor supply loop closure**: kanayama (Al + steel + Cu) → suki (tractor) → mitsuho (field) → harvest → kanayama (EoL recovery). Closes 4-actor agricultural supply loop within religious-corp boundary.\n\n## Design\n\n### Actor scaffold layout\n\n```\n20-actors/suki/\n├── README.edn                     # Overview + R0..R3 phase gates\n├── CLAUDE.md                     # Actor-local instructions\n└── manifest.jsonld               # DID + cell catalog + gate/non-goal arrays\n\n40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/cells/         # 9 Pregel cells (import-time RuntimeError R0)\n├── suki_chassis_fabrication/\n├── suki_powertrain_assembly/\n├── suki_cab_assembly/\n├── suki_hitch_pto_assembly/\n├── suki_paint_finishing/\n├── suki_electrical_ecu_load/\n├── suki_quality_field_test/\n├── suki_emissions_audit/\n└── suki_vehicle_attestation_binder/\n\n00-contracts/lexicons/com/etzhayyim/suki/\n├── chassisAttestation.json\n├── powertrainAttestation.json\n├── cabAttestation.json\n├── hitchPtoAttestation.json\n├── paintAttestation.json\n├── electricalEcuAttestation.json\n├── fieldTestRecord.json\n├── emissionsAuditRecord.json\n└── silenSukiReview.json\n```\n\n### Pregel cells (9, all R0 import-time RuntimeError)\n\n| # | Cell | Murakumo node | Phase | Input → Output |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | `suki_chassis_fabrication` | naphtali | frame | rawSteelLotIds + chassisDesignCid → chassisAttestation (HSLA-590/780 ladder frame; ≥2 robot witness) |\n| 2 | `suki_powertrain_assembly` | joseph | powertrain | chassisAttestation + engineLotId + transmissionLotId + hydraulicLotId → powertrainAttestation (G7 fuel guard: R0/R1 B100; R2+ LFP/H₂/methanol fuel-cell) |\n| 3 | `suki_cab_assembly` | zebulun | cab | chassisAttestation + cabBodyLotId + interiorLotId → cabAttestation (ROPS/FOPS rollover-protection certified; G14 open serial) |\n| 4 | `suki_hitch_pto_assembly` | joseph | hitch | powertrainAttestation + hitchLotId + ptoLotId → hitchPtoAttestation (G3 modular invariant; ISO 730 Cat I/II/III + ISO 500 540/1000 RPM standard) |\n| 5 | `suki_paint_finishing` | simeon | paint | cabAttestation + hitchPtoAttestation → paintAttestation (water-based KTL VOC <100 g/L; sarutahiko Tsutsumi inheritance) |\n| 6 | `suki_electrical_ecu_load` | levi | electrical | paintAttestation + ecuFirmwareCid + canBusConfigCid → electricalEcuAttestation (G9 open ECU + G10 no DRM; bootloader unlock default state per tsutae G2 echo) |\n| 7 | `suki_quality_field_test` | levi | test | electricalEcuAttestation → fieldTestRecord (drawbar test ASAE S496 + PTO test ASAE S217 + 3-point lift ISO 730; Norikata field driver R2+) |\n| 8 | `suki_emissions_audit` | levi | emissions | fieldTestRecord → emissionsAuditRecord (Stage V / EPA Tier 4 Final / 日本特殊自動車排ガス; R0/R1 tailpipe → R2+ zero) |\n| 9 | `suki_vehicle_attestation_binder` | judah | attest | emissionsAuditRecord → final `vehicleManufactureRecord` (per-tractor DID + open VIN + IPFS-pinned BoM + repair-history-ready blockchain) |\n\nCell ordering follows physical tractor assembly + terminal `vehicle_attestation_binder` on judah for per-VIN kotoba-datomic anchor (sarutahiko 9-cell + judah binder parity).\n\n### Lexicons (9, all R0 stub deferred to R1+)\n\n```\ncom.etzhayyim.suki.{\n  chassisAttestation       # Frame fabrication: HSLA-590/780, weld inspection ≥2 robot witness\n  powertrainAttestation    # Engine + transmission + hydraulic: G7 fuel type R-phase gate\n  cabAttestation           # Cab body + ROPS/FOPS cert + interior + G14 open serial\n  hitchPtoAttestation      # 3-point hitch Cat I/II/III + PTO 540/1000 RPM (ISO standard)\n  paintAttestation         # Water-based KTL + VOC + cure profile\n  electricalEcuAttestation # **G9 open ECU + G10 no DRM** + bootloader unlock default\n  fieldTestRecord          # Drawbar + PTO + 3-point lift test\n  emissionsAuditRecord     # Stage V / EPA Tier 4 / 日本特殊自動車 + R2+ zero tailpipe\n  silenSukiReview          # Council Lv6+ baseline review per R-phase activation\n}\n```\n\nTerminal `vehicleManufactureRecord` is emitted by `suki_vehicle_attestation_binder` as a derived per-VIN record (parallel to sarutahiko terminal binder pattern).\n\n### Constitutional Gates (G1–G14, IMMUTABLE per R0..R3)\n\n| Gate | Requirement | Rationale |\n|---|---|---|\n| **G1** | All hardware **open-source** — chassis CAD (FreeCAD `.fcstd`) + 3-point hitch + PTO spec + hydraulic schematic public | §2(e) anti-gatekeeping; sarutahiko G1 parity |\n| **G2** | All firmware **open-source** — ECU + hydraulic control + dash UI (no John Deere proprietary CAN); **bootloader unlock = default state** | §2(b); tsutae G2 echo |\n| **G3** | **Modular implement attachment** — Category I/II/III 3-point hitch + standard PTO 540/1000 RPM (ISO 730 + ISO 500); no parts pairing | §2(e) repair right; multi-vendor implement compat |\n| **G4** | Witness quorum **≥2 robot signers** (Mimi precision + Otete handling) per `vehicleManufactureRecord` Ed25519-bound | ADR-2605191524 |\n| **G5** | Bilingual (JA + EN) **operator manual + repair manual + ag-machine operator certification reference** + ag-mechanic training curriculum public | §2(e); G10 R2R |\n| **G6** | **§2(a) clearance** — no military tractor (artillery prime mover / military landrover-derivative / military engineering tractor / SOF support vehicle) / no riot-control / no surveillance modifications | sarutahiko N1+N6 echo |\n| **G7** | **Fuel transition phase gate**: R0/R1 B100 biodiesel + diesel hybrid acceptable; **R2+ LFP / H₂ / methanol fuel-cell only — pure-fossil phased out at R2 gate** | sarutahiko G7 fossil sunset parallel |\n| **G8** | Emissions: **EU Stage V + EPA Tier 4 Final + 日本特殊自動車排ガス規制** compliance R0-R1 tailpipe; **R2+ zero tailpipe** | sarutahiko G8 parity |\n| **G9** | **§2(b) anti-IP locking** — open ECU + open CAN bus + open hydraulic control protocol + open implement-detection (no DRM signature gate); ECU re-flash via openly published JTAG/UART | Right-to-Repair firmware foundation |\n| **G10** | **Right-to-Repair constitutional invariant** — no software lockouts requiring dealer authorization; **replacement parts catalogued openly** in repair manifest; ECU re-flash on parts swap **not gated by manufacturer**; diagnostic codes interpretable from open documentation | **religious-corp first explicit RTR constitutional first-class invariant** at firmware level (tsutae G3 = hardware level; suki G10 = firmware level; **dual-layer R2R**) |\n| **G11** | **Personnel vetting**: Adherent SBT + 大型特殊自動車免許 (JP) / agricultural machine operator certification (国際比較) + ag-machine mechanic SME registration | yakushi G4 + sarutahiko G11 pattern |\n| **G12** | **KPI cap — Wave 1 ≤200 hp** / max speed **≤40 km/h road / ≤15 km/h field** / **autonomous ≤ SAE J3016 Level 3 (Level 5 = N6 NEVER)** / max axle load ≤8 t | Anti-corporate-ag invariant; multi-gen farmer-land-relationship preservation; wadachi G7 echo |\n| **G13** | **Murakumo mesh placement** + LANDS.md land-trust integration (G14 farm location publication) + 30-day prior notice + 1 km community feedback | sarutahiko G13 + LANDS-integrated |\n| **G14** | Every tractor = **open VIN + per-vehicle DID** `did:web:etzhayyim.com:suki:vehicle:<vin>` + IPFS-pinned BoM + **repair-history-ready blockchain record** (per-VIN DID accepts `repairEvent` records throughout lifecycle) + EOL recyclability **≥85% by mass** (back to kanayama Wave 1 Al + Wave 2 steel + Wave 3 Cu) | sarutahiko G13+G14 echo |\n\n### Non-Goals (N1–N12, EXCLUDE from R0–R3 — matches sarutahiko + tsutae density)\n\n| Non-Goal | Scope | Deferral |\n|---|---|---|\n| **N1** | Military tractor (artillery prime mover / military landrover-derivative / military engineering / SOF support) | **Never** (§2(a) constitutional; G6 invariant) |\n| **N2** | Riot-control / armored police tractor | **Never** (§2(a)) |\n| **N3** | Mega-tractor (≥400 hp; mega-farm class; e.g., Case IH Steiger 600 / John Deere 9R class) | Post-R3 + Council Lv6+ supermajority (anti-corporate-ag invariant; igata N1 giga press parity) |\n| **N4** | **Closed ECU / proprietary CAN bus DRM / dealer-locked diagnostics / John Deere-style software lockout** | **Never** (§2(b) + §2(e) constitutional; G9 + G10 invariant) |\n| **N5** | Patent-locked seed integration (e.g., John Deere SeedStar planters that DRM-lock seed brand) | **Never** (§2(b) + §2(e); aligns with mitsuho G2 seed sovereignty) |\n| **N6** | **Fully autonomous tractor SAE J3016 Level 5** (unattended operation in field) | **Never** (§1.13 Wellbecoming farmer-land-relationship preservation; wadachi G7 echo) |\n| **N7** | Mining / construction tractor (bulldozer derivative / excavator / mining haul) | Post-R3 + Council Lv6+ supermajority (tatekata adjacency; kanayama N1 echo for mining) |\n| **N8** | Fossil-fuel-only powertrain R2+ (pure diesel without hybrid path) | **Never** R2+ (G7 fuel sunset; sarutahiko N10 parity) |\n| **N9** | External commercial sale to non-adherent / non-SBT-holder | SBT↔SBT internal carve-out only (ADR-2605192115 §3) |\n| **N10** | Pesticide-spraying integrated tractor (chemical-dispensing system pre-mounted) — aligns with mitsuho G6 (no synthetic pesticides) | **Never** (mitsuho G6 + Charter Rider §2(g)) |\n| **N11** | **Surveillance hardware integration** (always-on camera / GPS data sale to seed/chemical company / farm telemetry monetization) | **Never** (§2(c) farmer privacy; tsutae G6 echo) |\n| **N12** | Cross-jurisdiction mass production / Walmart-style centralized mass-distribution (anti-locality value; farms are inherently local; one factory ≤ region) | **Never** (G12 KPI cap + LANDS.md locality value) |\n\n### Robotics Classes\n\nR0 uses inherited + sarutahiko/kanayama-class reuse (minimal new robotics):\n\n| Class | Role | Inherited from | Notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Otete-heavy | Heavy-component handling (≥200 kg) | kuni-umi (sarutahiko-heavy inheritance) | Frame + powertrain placement |\n| Mimi-precision | μm-level alignment + AOI | kuni-umi | Chassis weld + ECU board inspection |\n| Migaki | Coil + body-panel surface inspector | kanayama (reuse) | Paint pre-inspection |\n| Kasane 重ね | Heavy-frame welding manipulator HSLA-590/780 multi-pass | sarutahiko (R1+ inheritance) | Frame welding |\n| Tsutsumi 包み | Paint booth water-based KTL robot | sarutahiko (R2+ inheritance) | Cab + chassis paint |\n| Akari 灯り | Electrical harness + ECU flash + diagnostics | sarutahiko (R1+ inheritance) | ECU + CAN bus load |\n| Norikata 乗り方 *(new, suki-native, R2+)* | Public-field test driver SAE Level 3 driver-in-seat | new class | Drawbar + PTO + 3-point lift test; ag-mechanic license-bound |\n| **Kuwa 鍬** *(new, suki-native, R2+)* | Precision hitch + PTO assembly robot | new class | ISO 730 Cat I/II/III alignment + PTO shaft torque control |\n\nMurakumo no-new-node 7-node fleet reuse only (naphtali / zebulun / joseph / simeon / dan / levi / judah); sarutahiko + kanayama node pattern parity.\n\n### Murakumo placement (design only at R0; activation requires R1+ ADR)\n\n| Node | suki cells |\n|---|---|\n| naphtali | suki_chassis_fabrication |\n| zebulun | suki_cab_assembly |\n| joseph | suki_powertrain_assembly + suki_hitch_pto_assembly |\n| simeon | suki_paint_finishing |\n| levi | suki_electrical_ecu_load + suki_quality_field_test + suki_emissions_audit |\n| dan | (R2+ recycling intake; future ADR) |\n| judah | suki_vehicle_attestation_binder (terminal) |\n\n## Roadmap (R0 → R3)\n\n| Phase | Scope | Murakumo fleet | Trigger |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| **R0** (this ADR) | Scaffold only. No live tractor assembly. 9 cells import-time RuntimeError. | No deployment | Immediate |\n| **R1** | Benchtop **1-tractor prototype** ≤50 hp + manual assembly + B100 biodiesel + agricultural engineering SME + ECU engineer SME + ag-mechanic SME + Kuwa/Norikata PoC firmware | naphtali + joseph + zebulun + levi + judah (5 nodes) | ADR-2605261515 (reserved) + Council Lv6+ vote + 3-DID SME registration + open RISC-V ECU equivalent BSP review |\n| **R2** | Pilot **≤10 tractors/year** + LFP battery hybrid 50-150 hp + Kuwa + Norikata field test + 30-day public comment + Annex-equivalent facility audit | 6 nodes (+ simeon paint) | ADR-2605261530 (reserved) + 30-day public comment + Kasane/Tsutsumi/Akari sarutahiko inheritance Council attestation + ag-machine operator license verification |\n| **R3** | Community-scale **≤100 tractors/year** + H₂ fuel-cell + zero tailpipe + 60-day public review + LANDS.md plant-site allocation + cross-actor mitsuho.harvest_robotics + kanayama EoL loop closure | Full 7-node fleet | ADR-2605261545 (reserved) + 60-day public review + cross-actor mitsuho R3 + kanayama R3 + 法務 (道路運送車両法 + 農業機械化促進法) 適合 audit |\n\nEach subsequent phase **requires its own ADR + Council Lv6+ ratification**.\n\n## Consequences\n\n### Positive\n\n- **Religious-corp first explicit Right-to-Repair constitutional first-class invariant**: G10 + N4 establish R2R at firmware level (suki ECU + CAN bus + diagnostics openness). Combined with tsutae G3 (device-level R2R: modular hardware + iFixit ≥9/10 + adhesive ≤5g), establishes **dual-layer R2R constitutional**: hardware (tsutae) + firmware (suki).\n- **Agricultural constitutional autonomy**: suki + mitsuho + kanayama supply loop (kanayama Al/steel/Cu → suki tractor → mitsuho field operation → kanayama EoL) closes 4-actor agricultural supply chain within religious-corp boundary. No John Deere / AGCO / Kubota commercial dependency at constitutional agricultural core.\n- **Manufacturing-side / operator-side sibling pattern stabilized**: sarutahiko ↔ wadachi (truck) + suki ↔ mitsuho (tractor) = 2 examples of split-artifact actor pattern. Constitutional transparency improved (manufacturing constraints vs. operation constraints are separated).\n- **Multi-gen farmer-land-relationship preservation**: G12 ≤200 hp Wave 1 + N3 mega-tractor (≥400 hp) deferred + N6 SAE Level 5 NEVER = small-farmer scale preserved. Combined with mitsuho G2 (seed sovereignty) + G6 (no synthetic pesticides), religious-corp agricultural Wellbecoming **物理基盤** established.\n- **G7 fuel sunset pattern reused**: R0/R1 B100 biodiesel + diesel hybrid → R2+ LFP / H₂ / methanol fuel-cell. religious-corp 第 2 actor declared phase-gate fuel transition. Pattern reusable for future heavy-machinery actors.\n- **Cross-actor robotics inheritance efficient**: Kasane (sarutahiko frame welding) + Tsutsumi (sarutahiko paint) + Akari (sarutahiko electrical) + Migaki (kanayama surface inspect) reused from existing actors. Only 2 new classes (Kuwa precision hitch/PTO + Norikata field-test driver). Total new robotics burden minimal.\n\n### Negative / Risk\n\n- **Capital + technical scale**: Farm tractor assembly = ~150-300 component categories (engine + transmission + hydraulic + cab + paint + electrical + tire + 3-point hitch + PTO + each implement interface). R3 ≤100 tractors/year でも capital scale 10-30 M USD class. Public Fund grant + Council 多数決必須.\n- **Engine BSP open-source dependency**: G2 (open firmware) + G9 (open ECU) + N4 (closed ECU NEVER) require engine ECU open BSP. Currently no commercially-available open ECU for ag-tractor engines (Bosch / Continental closed). religious-corp solution = (a) R1 = repurpose automotive open ECU (Cummins ISBe class open BSP partial), (b) R2 = custom open ECU based on iwakura-class SoC (silicon Wave 1 dependency), (c) **dual-track**: incremental R2R-only retrofit of existing tractors (Right-to-Repair kit) + new-build open ECU tractor.\n- **G7 fuel transition + engine availability**: B100 biodiesel + diesel hybrid R0/R1 acceptable, but R2+ H₂ / methanol fuel-cell tractor engines are emerging (JCB / Hyundai concept stage, not production). religious-corp R2 = **first-of-kind** H₂ tractor production possibility; technical and economic risk material. Hybrid (LFP + diesel) is more realistic R2 path.\n- **N3 mega-tractor deferred = constitutional tension with mitsuho R3 expansion**: mitsuho R3 ≤10 ha + cold-chain 1000 adherents pressure mega-tractor demand. religious-corp 解 = small-farmer cooperative model (multiple tractors ≤200 hp shared via SBT↔SBT cooperative) rather than single mega-tractor. mitsuho field cultivation cell + suki tractor catalog cooperative.\n- **Implement interoperability**: G3 (3-point hitch Cat I/II/III + PTO 540/1000 RPM) preserves multi-vendor implement compat, but commercial implement manufacturers (Kuhn / Krone / Lemken) may DRM-lock detection signatures. religious-corp 解 = G9 open implement-detection protocol + open-source implement catalog. Possible Tier-C actor (implement manufacturer) future carve-out.\n\n### Cross-actor integration\n\n| Counter-actor | Relationship | Wire (R-phase) |\n|---|---|---|\n| mitsuho (food/agriculture operator-side) | Operator of suki-manufactured tractors | mitsuho.harvest_robotics + field_cultivation ← suki.vehicleManufactureRecord (R2+ pilot OK with shared cooperative model) |\n| kanayama (circular metallurgy) | Upstream supplier (Al + steel + Cu) + downstream EoL consumer | suki.chassis_fabrication ← kanayama Wave 1+2+3 (R2+); kanayama.intake_qa ← suki.recycling_intake (R3 future cell) |\n| igata (HPDC) | Upstream supplier (engine block + transmission housing if HPDC-suitable) | suki.powertrain_assembly ← igata.partAttestation (R3 only; igata R3 readiness) |\n| silicon Wave 1 (iwakura SoC) | Upstream supplier (open ECU SoC integration R2+) | suki.electrical_ecu_load ← silicon.chip_manufacturing (R2+; silicon Wave 1 R2 dependency, tsutae G9 parallel) |\n| sarutahiko (heavy truck mfg) | Robotics class lineage (Kasane / Tsutsumi / Akari / Norimichi → Norikata) | Robotics reuse only (no direct cell wire) |\n| wadachi (autonomous-mobility operator) | N6 SAE Level 5 NEVER pattern shared (wadachi G7 echo) | Constitutional pattern reuse only (no direct cell wire) |\n| tsutae (handheld) | R2R constitutional first-class precedent (tsutae G3 hardware + suki G10 firmware = dual-layer) | Constitutional pattern reuse only |\n\nR0 = declaration only. R-phase activation per consumer/supplier R-phase gate.\n\n## Alternatives Considered\n\n### A1: Extend mitsuho (food/agriculture) with tractor manufacturing wave\n\n- **Pros**: No new actor; tractor stays close to mitsuho ag-domain\n- **Cons**: Breaks sarutahiko ↔ wadachi (manufacturing ↔ operator) sibling precedent. mitsuho is operator-side; mixing manufacturing internalizes constitutional surfaces that need clean separation.\n- **Decision**: REJECT — manufacturing-side / operator-side split is constitutional clarity benefit\n\n### A2: Extend sarutahiko with farm tractor sub-wave\n\n- **Pros**: Manufacturing-side actor reused; faster scaffold\n- **Cons**: sarutahiko = on-road heavy trucks (Class-8); tractors = off-road agricultural machines. Distinct constitutional surface: tractor R2R (G10) + farmer-land Wellbecoming + mitsuho cross-actor wire. Mixing dilutes both actors' constitutional clarity.\n- **Decision**: REJECT — clean Tier-B split\n\n### A3: Allow SAE Level 4 unattended R3+\n\n- **Pros**: Modern industry trend; John Deere autonomous tractor, AGCO Fendt concept; productivity gain\n- **Cons**: Unattended operation breaks farmer-land relationship (multi-gen ag-autonomy constitutional invariant). §1.13 Wellbecoming farmer-land bond preservation is constitutional substrate. wadachi G7 echo: operator-required.\n- **Decision**: REJECT — N6 SAE Level 5 NEVER; operator-required invariant\n\n### A4: Skip explicit Right-to-Repair invariant (use generic §2(e))\n\n- **Pros**: Lighter constitutional surface; simpler\n- **Cons**: John Deere DRM-lockout precedent (2018 FTC + 2023 MoU) is regulatory landmark deserving explicit constitutional first-class. tsutae G3 covered device-level R2R; suki G10 = firmware-level R2R complement. Dual-layer R2R is **religious-corp constitutional first explicit invariant**.\n- **Decision**: REJECT — explicit G10 + N4 R2R constitutional first-class invariant warrants the framing\n\n### A5: Allow mega-tractor (≥400 hp) at R3\n\n- **Pros**: Industry capability parity (Case IH Steiger 600 / John Deere 9R)\n- **Cons**: Breaks anti-corporate-ag invariant; favors mega-farm consolidation; conflicts with mitsuho small-farmer scale + cooperative model.\n- **Decision**: REJECT — N3 post-R3 + Council Lv6+ supermajority (igata N1 giga press parity)\n\n## References\n\n- ADR-2605252500 — sarutahiko heavy truck manufacturing R0 (manufacturing-side sibling pattern + 14 gates + 12 non-goals + G7 fuel transition + 9-cell + judah binder parity)\n- ADR-2605242000 — wadachi autonomous mobility operator-side R0 (operator-side sibling pattern + G7 SAE Level ≤4 echo for tractor SAE Level ≤3)\n- ADR-2605261015 — mitsuho food/agriculture operator-side R0 (operator-side counter-actor of suki manufacturing)\n- ADR-2605252400 — kanayama circular metallurgy R0 (Al + steel + Cu upstream supplier + EoL downstream consumer)\n- ADR-2605261200 — igata megacasting R0 (HPDC engine/transmission housing R3+ upstream supplier)\n- ADR-2605242515 — iwakura ternary inference ASIC (R2+ open ECU SoC integration target)\n- ADR-2605261300 — tsutae handheld communication R0 (dual-layer R2R precedent: tsutae G3 device + suki G10 firmware)\n- ADR-2605250500 — yakushi pharmaceutical master charter (14 gates + non-goals canonical pattern)\n- ADR-2605252200 — watatsumi civilian submersible R0 (YouTube methodology adoption + structural exclusion pattern)\n- ADR-2605192100 — etzhayyim Mission Charter (§1.13 Wellbecoming + §1.3 multi-gen ag-autonomy)\n- ADR-2605192200 — Charter Compliance Rider v2.0 (§2(b) IP locking + §2(c) surveillance + §2(d) addiction + §2(e) repair/anti-gatekeeping + §2(g) sustainability)\n- ADR-2605191524 — transparent force swarm broadcast witness quorum (G4 invariant)\n- ADR-2605201400 — kuni-umi planetary-infra fleet (robotics class lineage)\n- YouTube `aSmoLQKdX9E` — \"Inside Ultra-Modern European Factories Building Massive Farm Tractors From Scratch\" (methodology source; manufacturing methodology adopted; John Deere-class DRM ECU + dealer-locked diagnostics + patent-locked seed integration + mega-farm consolidation + fossil-fuel-only powertrain + surveillance hardware integration all explicitly rejected)\n", :adr/path "90-docs/adr/2605261500-suki-farm-tractor-tier-b-actor-r0.edn", :adr/source-repo "root", :adr/topic "suki/farm-tractor/manufacturing", :adr/last_verified "2026-05-26T00:00:00Z", :adr/date "2026-05-26T00:00:00Z", :adr/authoritative true, :adr/related ["adr-2605252500-sarutahiko-heavy-truck-manufacturing-r0" "adr-2605242000-roso-pattern-frontier-distill" "adr-2605261015" "adr-2605252400-kanayama-circular-metallurgy-r0" "adr-2605261115-igata-megacasting-tier-b-actor-r0" "adr-2605192100-etzhayyim-mission-charter" "adr-2605192200-etzhayyim-ip-free-release-charter-rider"]}]
